{
  "question": "Which hosts in geneOS could make ethanol, which models sit on their pages, and what ceiling does each give on glucose?",
  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "text": "Within geneOS, the only host page that has a genome-scale model on the shelf is the Saccharomyces cerevisiae S288C-derived host; both its shelf models (iMM904 and Yeast9) name that host.",
      "recordIds": [],
      "paperIds": [],
      "support": "direct",
      "provenance": "unverified",
      "passages": [],
      "evidenceIds": [],
      "moduleRefs": [
        "geneos/host/s-cerevisiae-s288c",
        "geneos/model/iMM904",
        "geneos/model/Yeast9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "text": "The Saccharomyces cerevisiae S288C genome-scale model iMM904 has a native ethanol route through pyruvate decarboxylase and alcohol dehydrogenase, with ethanol leaving through its ethanol exchange; its flux-balance ceiling on glucose is reported in the evidence.",
      "recordIds": [],
      "paperIds": [],
      "support": "direct",
      "provenance": "computed",
      "passages": [],
      "evidenceIds": [
        "ev-6a660880be72f7be"
      ],
      "moduleRefs": [
        "geneos/model/iMM904"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "text": "The Saccharomyces cerevisiae S288C genome-scale model Yeast9 has a native ethanol route through pyruvate decarboxylase and alcohol dehydrogenase, with ethanol leaving through its file's ethanol exchange; its flux-balance ceiling on glucose is reported in the evidence.",
      "recordIds": [],
      "paperIds": [],
      "support": "direct",
      "provenance": "computed",
      "passages": [],
      "evidenceIds": [
        "ev-b616b00ba65aeadb"
      ],
      "moduleRefs": [
        "geneos/model/Yeast9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c4",
      "text": "The two Saccharomyces cerevisiae S288C models give the same flux-balance ceiling for ethanol from glucose, in both mass and molar terms, at the same glucose uptake bound.",
      "recordIds": [],
      "paperIds": [],
      "support": "inferred",
      "provenance": "computed",
      "passages": [],
      "evidenceIds": [
        "ev-6a660880be72f7be",
        "ev-b616b00ba65aeadb"
      ],
      "moduleRefs": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c5",
      "text": "No other host page in geneOS (including the E. coli expression strains, Komagataella phaffii GS115, Trichoderma reesei, Bacillus subtilis, Corynebacterium glutamicum, Yarrowia, Kluyveromyces, Aspergillus, Myceliophthora and the CEN.PK113-7D and S288C strain pages) has a genome-scale model linked to it, so no ethanol ceiling is available for those hosts from geneOS.",
      "recordIds": [],
      "paperIds": [],
      "support": "unsupported",
      "provenance": "unverified",
      "passages": [],
      "evidenceIds": [],
      "moduleRefs": [
        "geneos/host/ecoli",
