        "geneos/host/m-thermophila",
        "geneos/host/s-cerevisiae-cenpk113-7d",
        "geneos/host/s-cerevisiae-s288c"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "gaps": [
    "Host pages in geneOS list badges only (for example GRAS, secretion, reference genome); none of the host rows states an ethanol pathway, so whether any non-yeast host could make ethanol is not established from geneOS.",
    "The E. coli core model (e_coli_core) and the iJO1366 E. coli model are on the shelf, but the ceiling tool only takes ethanol on iMM904 and Yeast9, so no ethanol ceiling exists for E. coli in this platform. A ceiling for E. coli would need a route check and a run the tool supports.",
    "The geneOS pathway kind returned no rows for ethanol, so no pathway page documents an ethanol route for any host.",
    "The geneOS ceiling is a flux-balance upper bound at the model's glucose uptake setting, not a measured yield; no measured ethanol yield from geneOS hosts was found in this module.",
    "The CEN.PK113-7D strain page has no linked model, though it is a common ethanol physiology reference; its ceiling is not computed here."
  ],
